-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-md\\\">\\n          Chaque pièce est une exploration de la forme et de la matière. Mon travail se concentre sur l'essentiel : la\\n          coupe, le tombé, et l'émotion visuelle que dégage un vêtement dans son environnement.\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\\\"pt-6\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\"\\n            class=\\\"inline-block border-b border-black pb-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform duration-300\\\">\\n            En savoir plus\\n          </a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- Projects Grid (Parallax Items) -->\\n  <section id=\\\"work\\\" class=\\\"bg-black text-white py-32 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"px-8 mb-20\\\">\\n      <h3 class=\\\"font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl mb-4 italic\\\">Portfolio</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest opacity-40\\\">Sélections 2024 — 2025</p>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-white/10\\\">\\n      <!-- Project 1 -->\\n      <div\\n        class=\\\"group relative overflow-hidden bg-black aspect-square md:aspect-video flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <img  src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1538329972958-465d6d2144ed?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w0NzEyNjZ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw1fHxzdHlsZXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzY5MTU3ODU1fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080\\\" class=\\\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-1000 project-img\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"relative z-10 text-center transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-4 duration-500\\\">\\n          <h4 class=\\\"font-serif text-3xl italic\\\">Minimal Silk</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\\\">\\n            Éditorial</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Project 2 -->\\n      <div\\n  